"Lax1dude","glsl/deferred/shader_pack_icon.png","Guns Mod","1.3.7","A new and exciting weapon mod with a unique vision. Adding nine weapons, all can be highly customised to create your own unique variant. Using attachments and enchantments, you can increase the stats of a weapon to create an even more powerful version. Dyes can be used to change the colour of any weapon and attachment. This mod also adds grenades and stun grenades!","MrCrayfish","MIT","eaglerz/mods/guns.png","Elytra Swap Mod","v1.0","A mod that allows you to swap your elytra with a chestplate in your inventory, letting you easily switch between armor and flight without needing to move items around manually. Press the assigned keybind (default: F) to swap your currently equipped chestplate with an elytra from your inventory, or vice versa. This mod is perfect for players who want to quickly switch between combat and flight modes without interrupting their gameplay flow. Note: Can get you banned on servers as this considered a cheat.",
"UrBudPenguin","eaglerz/mods/elytaswap.png","EaglercraftZ Test Mod","1.0.0","This does nothing so install it if you want but it won\'t do anything.","Unlicensed","eaglerz/mods/favicon.png","A simple mod that makes everything fully bright all the time. No more dark caves or night time!","eaglerz/mods/fullbright.png","A mod that shows a fake FPS counter on the screen to make you feel better about your performance and others around you.","eaglerz/mods/fake.png","Wisp Proxy","A patch for eaglercraft that allows joining regular online mode minecraft servers from the browser, tunneled over wisp.",
